# ── Repo-wide ignores for this multi-project Flutter repo ──
# Each subproject (example1..example4, flutter_animation_course) also carries
# its own Flutter-template .gitignore. This file is the safety net that covers
# the repo root and any new project added before its template lands.

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.history/
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
# .vscode/ is intentionally NOT ignored — launch configs are worth sharing.

# Dart / Flutter / Pub
**/.dart_tool/
**/.packages
**/.pub/
**/.pub-cache/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/build/
**/doc/api/
**/coverage/
**/migrate_working_dir/
*.class
*.log
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# Android
**/.gradle/
**/.cxx/
**/local.properties
**/captures/
**/gradle-wrapper.jar
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java

# iOS / macOS
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/xcuserdata/
**/.swiftpm/

# Linux / Windows desktop
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/

# Secrets — never commit signing material
**/key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
*.env
.env.*
